# NexaPOS Lite till: the page and its scripts are checked again on every visit (a cheap "not modified" answer when
# nothing changed). Without this the server let an iPad keep an OLD copy of the page for hours and of the scripts for
# a week, so a cashier could be using a till that was missing the newest features.
# Same form as the rule already working in ../app/.htaccess on this host.
<FilesMatch "\.(html|js|css)$">
Header set Cache-Control "no-cache, must-revalidate"
</FilesMatch>
